1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,445
HyunOptic is a local research workspace for reviewing
ophthalmic AI predictions. A

2
00:00:04,445 --> 00:00:08,889
model can produce a measurable cup to disc ratio while
locating the

3
00:00:08,889 --> 00:00:13,334
wrong structure. The task here is to inspect that evidence,
preserve unresolved

4
00:00:13,334 --> 00:00:15,556
decisions, and export a traceable record.

5
00:00:16,556 --> 00:00:20,942
This demonstration uses only synthetic images and two real CPU
trained PyTorch

6
00:00:20,942 --> 00:00:25,327
models. Seed forty three is the primary model, and seed forty
two

7
00:00:25,327 --> 00:00:29,713
is the comparison. The public preparation command creates both
models and an

8
00:00:29,713 --> 00:00:33,368
isolated workspace without private research weights or an API
key.

9
00:00:34,368 --> 00:00:39,165
I select four synthetic images and one intentionally
unreadable input, then confirm

10
00:00:39,165 --> 00:00:43,962
local retention. The session copies images to this computer.
The application allows

11
00:00:43,962 --> 00:00:48,759
thirty megabytes per file. The unreadable case stays visible
instead of disappearing

12
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:49,959
from the total.

13
00:00:50,959 --> 00:00:55,863
Clicking Process next images runs actual image only inference
with verified model

14
00:00:55,863 --> 00:01:00,768
bundles. The completed session contains four processed images,
eight model predictions, and

15
00:01:00,768 --> 00:01:05,672
one input error. Processing is synchronous and bounded. This
edited sequence is

16
00:01:05,672 --> 00:01:08,125
not a real time speed benchmark.

17
00:01:09,125 --> 00:01:13,702
The queue orders execution failures, invalid measurements, and
model disagreement for inspection.

18
00:01:13,702 --> 00:01:18,279
Opening a completed case shows the complete source image. Full
context matters

19
00:01:18,279 --> 00:01:22,856
because a plausible measurement alone does not establish that
the model found

20
00:01:22,856 --> 00:01:24,001
the correct anatomy.

21
00:01:25,001 --> 00:01:29,763
These are the two actual model overlays on the same synthetic
image.

22
00:01:29,763 --> 00:01:34,525
Both predictions produce measurements, but the boundaries
differ. Disagreement is a descriptive

23
00:01:34,525 --> 00:01:39,288
ordering signal, not calibrated confidence or diagnostic risk.
Both models can also

24
00:01:39,288 --> 00:01:41,272
agree on a wrong structure.

25
00:01:42,272 --> 00:01:47,147
The review state can remain unreviewed, become reviewed, or be
held. Here

26
00:01:47,147 --> 00:01:52,022
I select held and the reason uncertain, then save. A held
decision

27
00:01:52,022 --> 00:01:56,897
requires a reason. The software record does not certify
anatomical correctness, clinical

28
00:01:56,897 --> 00:01:58,928
approval, or independent human review.

29
00:01:59,928 --> 00:02:04,684
After reloading the browser, I reopen the stored session and
the same

30
00:02:04,684 --> 00:02:09,440
case. Held and uncertain remain recorded. Revision checks
prevent a stale tab

31
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:14,196
from silently replacing a newer decision. The application also
supports recovery of

32
00:02:14,196 --> 00:02:16,574
unfinished processing while retaining completed results.

33
00:02:17,574 --> 00:02:22,588
I build the evidence ZIP and download the verified package. A
separate

34
00:02:22,588 --> 00:02:27,603
command line check accepted all six payloads. Default exports
exclude original images,

35
00:02:27,603 --> 00:02:32,617
masks, filenames, local paths and private notes. Hashes do not
guarantee anonymity,

36
00:02:32,617 --> 00:02:36,795
and the local database is not encrypted by the application.

37
00:02:37,795 --> 00:02:42,522
Separate execution checks matched repeated prediction digests
and preserved two hundred predictions

38
00:02:42,522 --> 00:02:47,249
after a controlled interruption of one hundred repeated
synthetic cases. A changed

39
00:02:47,249 --> 00:02:51,976
copied model bundle failed without erasing prior decisions.
Repeated cases are not

40
00:02:51,976 --> 00:02:55,916
independent patients, and this was not an operating system
crash.

41
00:02:56,916 --> 00:03:02,253
The local suite passed three hundred twenty six tests. Linux,
Windows, and

42
00:03:02,253 --> 00:03:07,590
actual PyTorch CPU training checks also passed in continuous
integration. Earlier real

43
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:12,928
data transfer failures motivate this workflow. Synthetic
execution does not establish clinical

44
00:03:12,928 --> 00:03:16,041
accuracy, ranking efficiency, or measured time savings.

45
00:03:17,041 --> 00:03:22,232
The repository includes source, setup instructions, aggregate
research results and AI disclosures.

46
00:03:22,232 --> 00:03:27,423
All work shown was prepared before the hackathon. This is an
AI

47
00:03:27,423 --> 00:03:32,614
operated demonstration with synthetic narration and edited
screenshot timing. HyunOptic remains research

48
00:03:32,614 --> 00:03:36,507
only and must not guide diagnosis or patient care.
